.", "DR. ÁNGELA MARTÍN PALMERO:Director científica and head of the Clinical Nutrition and Dietetics Unit at Hospital San Pedro.", "DR. JULIA OCÓN BRETÓN:Director científica and head of the Clinical Nutrition and Dietetics Unit at Hospital Clínico Universitario Lozano Blesa.", "MESA REDONDA DE CASOS CLÍNICOS. NORTE:A round table event discussing clinical cases related to nutrition and diabetes management.", "FIBROSIS QUÍSTICA:Fibrosis quística, also known as cystic fibrosis, is a genetic disorder that primarily affects the lungs and digestive system. It is caused by a mutation in the CFTR gene and is inherited in an autosomal recessive manner. The condition was diagnosed in the patient at the age of 2 and is characterized by a range of complications, including malnutrition and diabetes, which can significantly worsen the patient's prognosis. Due to the complexity of the disease, it necessitates multidisciplinary management and specialized nutritional care to address the various health challenges faced by affected individuals.", "ENFERMEDAD INFLAMATORIA INTESTINAL:Enfermedad Inflamatoria Intestinal refers to a group of inflammatory conditions affecting the gastrointestinal tract. These conditions may necessitate specific dietary interventions to manage symptoms and improve patient outcomes. Additionally, Enfermedad Inflamatoria Intestinal should be considered in the differential diagnosis of mitochondrial diseases, highlighting its relevance in a broader medical context.", "CÁNCER DE CABEZA Y CUELLO:CÁNCER DE CABEZA Y CUELLO refers to a type of cancer that affects the head and neck region. This form of cancer often necessitates nutritional support during treatment due to the challenges it poses in these areas. Specifically, it includes conditions such as carcinoma epidermoide of the hemilangue, which is a type of squamous cell carcinoma that can occur in the oral cavity. Overall, CÁNCER DE CABEZA Y CUELLO encompasses various malignancies within the head and neck, highlighting the importance of comprehensive care and support for affected patients."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}